<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_8a9f320a-5c7e-4d3f-be1f-6f70835cd7fd"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_62a29d5a-ec8b-433f-9a93-366e5653f9a8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_0b06c401-6cfb-4b26-a6f9-98282b60cb48"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Effect of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_09129420-b0db-4460-9b0f-b00d64c20450"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act places on any person any
obligation enforceable in a court of law or administrative review
body.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f2bf653f-61f8-4a97-b15f-af2fd357c47f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1), a failure to
comply with a provision of this Act&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_06a0a7a6-d1bb-4adf-9072-699408783423" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">does not prevent the introduction of any Bill in,
or the passage of a Bill through, a House of Parliament or prevent assent
being given to any Bill, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2cc27f9a-6538-42b4-a32d-c196ad2b2660" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">does not affect the validity of any legislation,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b4346f0c-e3c4-487f-a395-e9dbe622c9cb" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">does not affect the validity of any action taken
by any public official or agency, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_db0683da-8d12-46f0-a218-ef4fad3f4098" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">does not expose any person to civil or criminal
liability.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6d901394-d877-4cb8-8dd0-fb98d7b85bce"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Accordingly, no court or administrative review
body has jurisdiction or power to consider any question involving compliance
or non-compliance with this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b3827570-525a-472e-86de-ac756a11ee58"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section does not apply to the other
provisions of this Part or to Schedule 1.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b034dab8-08be-4703-bb29-0446bf36b558"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_9a6b8ddc-b081-44df-a508-3b2db94204c2"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0553dc8a-797c-4343-93fa-2eda1613d91d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_d42cd82f-9a25-4a8d-b8b1-33d112b1fcde"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Acts not affected by this Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act does not affect the provisions of any of
the following Acts&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_29604d32-2e7b-446c-b1d1-8f1f2f6bc9ac" id="sec.11-para1">
<block><txt break.before="1"><legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Audit Act
1983</i></name></legref></txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b9cd06e3-de7b-46fd-a312-27cecfdf7f38" id="sec.11-para1-oc.2">
<block><txt break.before="1"><legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-2018-055"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref></txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_68e41253-d622-4a47-9cea-3b7005c5e612" id="sec.11-para1-oc.3">
<block><txt break.before="1"><legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-1989-134"><name emphasis="yes"><i>State Owned Corporations Act
1989</i></name></legref></txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 11:</b> Am 2018 No 70,
Schs 3.23, 4.35.</txt></content>
</level>


